    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2667c8c832008afe48b7f9e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝向胜利「勇往直前」──是我的stance，\\n我请鲁道夫──帮忙翻译，成日文了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "98a821b0f8e8e8cd00aa4cc382d916ab974db7f9accbe624a6349792ef4e2684",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5203d986a56ce2c1a1246881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Yes. 特别是在比赛前──会喝优质的水──\\n今天早上──我就喝了──法国的气泡水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1cb073b1ad2310414b65afa2e0985bf10258a8db3531280fcc7481f040c7986",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc639e0d126c621e34032703",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Plastic制的叶子──放在便当里──\\n看起来──是很漂亮，但……why？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c1189887ad57c51292c133f3e6bc9eb008343f061ea5a33c819393bf77a0f09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbcf6a9d966d3f6b62e26e87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去澡堂泡热水澡！然后回去时穿着木屐，\\n「咖答咖答」地走去神社祈祷胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "943e0e3a4a375f498c007302e09666df18b3b18d291db546eb2ba118708e62c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41afc1d615eed8953dc518b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝向胜利「勇往直前」──是我的stance，\\n我请鲁道夫──帮忙翻译，成日文了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "98a821b0f8e8e8cd00aa4cc382d916ab974db7f9accbe624a6349792ef4e2684",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
