      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fd87e86462f16a597f80dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小千表示「所有赛马娘都会迎来春天」\\n──所以今天会让大家看见我的「春天」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9487a79ef2dfa8f0414ade8da98ba4d9560491a21fc2e234ebd9bb9a8b1ed040",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bfdf4c8437fb42c671d39f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，受到我父亲的影响。比赛前我做了父亲\\n亲自传授的奥姆蛋替自己打气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9b35e3f0691fd46fe2396bdc48b56cffc33ce3643832c3c9260391d208744e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d71c06039df6e7de365882",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "寻找隐藏名店！每当我远征参加竞赛时，\\n一定会找出一间来为自己充饱电♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73816a152bba65350a5cc34c4581d4c04d58523a7d32b15326afee3eaa6c4ef4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
